# Real-time marking

Answer keys may be stored on questions. Marking is not deferred until submit.

- On every trusted answer save, compute and persist `auto_marks` for objective and configured short-answer questions.
- Administrators may view saved answers and assign `manual_marks` while an attempt is still `active`.
- Recalculate `auto_score`, `manual_score`, and `final_score` after each save or manual mark.
- Expiry and submit still lock further candidate changes. Already-computed marks remain.
- While an attempt is `active`, never send `correct_answer`, acceptable variants, marks, or scores to candidate-facing APIs or UI.
- After an attempt is locked, MCQ-only exams may show the candidate their result. See the candidate MCQ results rule.
- Changing the candidate clock must not affect save, marking, or expiry checks.
